{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060346/block/singleImage/3248767/df/01M5VNZGASJAHW9XJV04VPGMWS.png?updatedAt=1793012245\"/><figcaption>青沙公路貨車車轆過熱起火冒濃煙，消防開喉撲救。(車cam L（香港群組）)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (26 日 ) 下午 12 時 40 分，一輛貨車沿青沙公路往九龍方向行駛，駛至近大埔公路大圍段、香港文化博物館對開時，右後方車轆突然起火，並冒出大量黑煙，男司機見狀及時自行逃生。 消防員接報後到場開喉灌救，其後將火救熄，事件中無人受傷，經初步調查後相信是貨車車轆過熱肇禍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:41:01.710773+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:08.404139+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:16.936850+00:00","content_hash":"4ee7a177c30bc4e6af686d02e139d2b29df8696e3516111117fd5864ba0ec6cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:41:01.710773+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}